---
const channels = ['飞书', '钉钉', '微信', 'QQ', 'Telegram', 'Web'];
---

<header
  id="top"
  style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#6fd6d2 url('/assets/hero-bg.png') center 28% / cover no-repeat;"
>
  <video
    id="hc-hero-video"
    src="/assets/hero-bg.mp4"
    autoplay
    muted
    loop
    playsinline
    preload="auto"
    style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.2s ease;transform:scale(1.06);"
  ></video>

  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6,58,68,0.44) 0%, rgba(6,58,68,0.14) 32%, rgba(6,58,68,0) 58%);pointer-events:none;"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 70% at 50% 6%, rgba(6,58,68,0.28), transparent 55%);pointer-events:none;"></div>

  <div
    class="hero-inner"
    style="position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:150px 28px 0;text-align:center;color:#fff;"
  >
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center;"
    >
      <span style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:#ffd0a8;flex-shrink:0;"></span>
      <span>Self-hosted AI agent · 开源可私有化 · 落地陪跑</span>
    </div>

    <h1
      data-reveal
      class="hero-title"
      style="font-size:clamp(28px, 5.2vw, 66px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 22px;text-shadow:0 2px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);text-wrap:balance;"
    >
      把 AI Agent,装进<span style="color:#ffd8bd;">你自己的企业内网</span>
    </h1>

    <p
      data-reveal
      style="font-size:clamp(16px, 2vw, 21px);line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 12px;text-shadow:0 1px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);"
    >
      开源可私有化的企业级 Agent 平台 · 行业能力库 · 落地陪跑服务。数据不出门,接入你的飞书 / 钉钉 / 微信,两周看到可用样例。
    </p>

    <p data-reveal style="font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);letter-spacing:0.01em;margin:0 0 34px;">
      Self-hosted AI agent for everywhere. Open-source, self-hostable, powered by Claude Code.
    </p>

    <div
      data-reveal
      class="hero-cta"
      style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:34px;"
    >
      <a
        href="https://claw.shakaka.xyz"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:12px;transition:transform .15s, box-shadow .2s;"
      >在线试用</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/riba2534/happyclaw"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        style="background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.32), rgba(255,255,255,0.08));color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:14px;backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(180%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(180%);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.55), inset 0 -8px 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.14), 0 8px 26px rgba(6,58,68,0.18);transition:background .25s, transform .15s;"
      >View on GitHub ↗</a>
      <a
        href="mailto:business@happyclaw.cc?subject=HappyClaw%20企业咨询"
        style="background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.32), rgba(255,255,255,0.08));color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:14px;backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(180%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(180%);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.55), inset 0 -8px 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.14), 0 8px 26px rgba(6,58,68,0.18);transition:background .25s, transform .15s;"
      >联系商务</a>
    </div>

    <div
      data-reveal
      class="hero-channels"
      style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:6px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:48px;"
    >
      <span style="opacity:.7;">六端接入</span>
      {
        channels.map((c, i) => (
          <>
            <span style="color:#fff;">{c}</span>
            {i < channels.length - 1 && <span style="opacity:.4;">·</span>}
          </>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div
      data-reveal
      class="hero-shot-wrap"
      style="position:relative;margin-bottom:-60px;max-width:1144px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;"
    >
      <div
        style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#101014;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(6,58,68,0.35);"
      >
        <div
          style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);"
        >
          <span style="width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:99px;background:#ff5f57;"></span>
          <span style="width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:99px;background:#febc2e;"></span>
          <span style="width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:99px;background:#28c840;"></span>
          <span
            class="font-mono"
            style="margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#9a9aa5;"
          >happyclaw.cc</span>
        </div>
        <img
          id="hc-hero-shot"
          src="/assets/app-home.png"
          alt="HappyClaw Web 界面"
          style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<script>
  // Fade in the hero video once it starts playing
  const v = document.getElementById('hc-hero-video') as HTMLVideoElement | null;
  if (v) {
    const show = () => (v.style.opacity = '1');
    if (v.readyState >= 2) show();
    else v.addEventListener('playing', show, { once: true });
  }
</script>
